  "description": "Sherry FitzGerald Mark Kelly has the pleasure of offering No. 22 Cedar View, Bandon to the rental market. This modern, bright and spacious three-bedroom end-of-terrace home is located within the Cedar View residential development.\n\nSituated in a quiet cul-de-sac, the property is within minutes' walk of Bandon Town Centre, while Cork City, Cork Airport, UCC, CUH, MTU, Eli Lilly and other major employers are all within a 15/20-minute drive.\n\nThis property is being offered to the rental market for the first time and is available immediately. The property comes fully furnished and is finished to a high standard throughout.\n\nAccommodation includes:\n\nGround Floor\nEntrance Hall, Kitchen/Dining Room, Living Room and Guest WC.\n\nFirst Floor\nMaster bedroom with an ensuite, 2 additional bedrooms and the main family bathroom \n\nA-Rated Home with Air-to-Water Heat Pump\n\nViewing of this property comes highly recommended by the sole letting agent\n\nTo apply, please contact our office by email.",
